  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Counterspell, casting class feature, magic skill bonus +5.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you strike a target with a weapon attack, you may spend a spell point as an immediate action to attempt to dispel an existing magical effect on the target using your Counterspell ability, or multiple effects with your Improved or Greater Counterspell ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
